WEBVTT

00:03.740 --> 00:06.310
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.490 --> 00:10.420
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.430 --> 00:14.020
What he is?

00:14.210 --> 00:18.600
What he wants?

00:22.270 --> 00:29.680
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.680 --> 00:34.750
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:37.030 --> 00:44.010
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.430 --> 00:51.880
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.680 --> 00:57.170
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.390 --> 01:00.680
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:01.030 --> 01:04.530
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.750 --> 01:08.110
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.410 --> 01:11.940
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:12.140 --> 01:15.490
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.810 --> 01:19.330
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:19.330 --> 01:24.240
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:31.100 --> 01:35.790
Save Robot Farm!!

01:44.180 --> 01:46.230
Atom!

01:47.710 --> 01:49.290
Where is he?

01:49.380 --> 01:52.250
Please let me see the robot Atom.

01:52.460 --> 01:53.750
Wait! Wait!

01:54.230 --> 01:56.220
Where is Atom?

01:56.420 --> 01:59.440
Something terrible is happening
on Robot Farm.

01:59.600 --> 02:02.430
Please let me see Atom.

02:02.480 --> 02:05.190
Young girl, calm down.

02:05.570 --> 02:07.370
Do you need to see Atom?

02:07.500 --> 02:08.990
That's exactly why I'm here!

02:09.170 --> 02:10.600
What happened?

02:10.740 --> 02:11.540
Hi, Atom.

02:11.840 --> 02:13.500
Atom? Are you Atom?

02:13.940 --> 02:15.840
Yeah....

02:16.610 --> 02:17.940
Listen up, Atom.

02:18.080 --> 02:21.480
Since last night,
my farm has been rocking!

02:21.620 --> 02:23.310
Rocking?

02:23.650 --> 02:24.380
Right!

02:24.520 --> 02:27.550
Even the police are too scared
to come help us.

02:27.690 --> 02:31.940
Robot Farm will be destroyed
unless we do something!

02:32.060 --> 02:34.000
My grandpa said...

02:34.160 --> 02:37.060
Atom is the best robot of all!

02:37.200 --> 02:39.130
You must be able to help!

02:39.300 --> 02:40.270
Wait a minute!

02:40.440 --> 02:43.300
Does your grandpa
also live on Robot Farm?

02:43.740 --> 02:47.700
Grandpa was crushed by tomatoes...

02:47.880 --> 02:49.040
because of the rocking.

02:49.480 --> 02:51.590
Crushed by tomatoes?

02:54.880 --> 02:58.000
You must have had
a bad dream, young girl

02:58.020 --> 02:59.350
I'm not kidding!

02:59.360 --> 03:01.430
If it were cucumbers
instead of tomatoes...

03:01.440 --> 03:03.980
Grandpa might have been killed.

03:06.960 --> 03:08.510
I'm not going to ask you guys.

03:08.570 --> 03:10.300
Keep laughing!

03:14.870 --> 03:16.130
Hey, wait!

03:16.370 --> 03:18.360
What is your name?

03:19.170 --> 03:21.770
Where is Robot Farm?

03:21.910 --> 03:23.970
I'll help.

03:29.950 --> 03:34.390
I'm Mimi from Rainbow Valley.
Robot Farm is in Rainbow Valley

03:35.090 --> 03:36.280
Thanks!

03:36.700 --> 03:38.740
Hey, Atom, where are you going?

03:39.560 --> 03:43.500
I'm going to Robot Farm
in Rainbow Valley.

03:49.140 --> 03:51.000
You can't tell them
where we're going!

03:51.140 --> 03:53.820
What if they are bad guys?

03:53.870 --> 03:57.580
Don't worry. They are nice guys.

03:57.610 --> 03:59.510
You're stupid!

03:59.580 --> 04:03.700
You never know
what they may be thinking.

04:03.750 --> 04:07.120
If you trust people so easily,
you'll have to pay for it.

04:07.290 --> 04:08.490
Let's go!

04:10.590 --> 04:11.580
Atom!

04:11.690 --> 04:13.240
You can fly, can't you?

04:21.200 --> 04:23.900
Did Atom head to Robot Farm?

04:23.950 --> 04:26.210
Yes. Isn't that the farm...

04:26.210 --> 04:31.080
where unique robots
make unbelievable vegetables?

04:31.110 --> 04:32.220
Yes, it is.

04:32.250 --> 04:34.240
It's an amazing farm.

04:34.350 --> 04:38.900
If it's successful
it'll be a fantastic farm...

04:38.900 --> 04:41.300
where humans
and robots work together.

04:41.340 --> 04:46.270
But the security guards said
the farm might be rocking.

04:46.400 --> 04:47.550
What?

04:49.230 --> 04:50.180
What is this?

04:50.200 --> 04:52.970
The climate-control tower...

04:52.990 --> 04:54.890
the most innovative system
at Robot Farm.

04:54.900 --> 05:00.280
It controls climate with electromagnetic
waves using terrestrial heat energy.

05:02.080 --> 05:05.780
Hope nothing happened to the system.

05:07.150 --> 05:09.150
That's great!

05:09.390 --> 05:14.390
Your grandpa, Dr. Tonerico,
developed the system by himself.

05:14.490 --> 05:17.680
Yeah. He's a brilliant scientist.

05:18.160 --> 05:21.400
That's a large lake
that dried up ages ago.

05:21.630 --> 05:24.040
The weather around here is unstable.

05:24.080 --> 05:29.370
Without the climate-control system,
the farm couldn't have been built here.

05:30.370 --> 05:35.500
When we first arrived at the farm,
it was a sterile wasteland

05:35.680 --> 05:38.980
The deserted houses and the old dam
in the mountain were all that were left

05:39.350 --> 05:43.080
We immediately started developing
the weather-control device...

05:43.790 --> 05:46.720
and helped improve the seeds
to plant on the farm.

05:47.090 --> 05:49.950
We also cultivated the sterile land.

05:50.090 --> 05:54.010
And finally, the climate-control tower,
Morning Glory Tower, was completed...

05:54.130 --> 05:56.650
and we began to grow vegetables

05:57.440 --> 06:02.550
It took years to turn this wasteland
into Rainbow Valley.

06:02.910 --> 06:07.620
So those vegetables
must be like your babies.

06:08.180 --> 06:10.030
That is Rainbow Valley.

06:24.090 --> 06:25.610
Gigantic!

06:25.670 --> 06:28.360
These are the out-of-this-world
vegetables my grandpa and I grew.

06:28.600 --> 06:31.380
One tomato can make
100 bottles of ketchup.

06:31.450 --> 06:32.510
Wow!

06:34.870 --> 06:36.290
That's Vegeta.

06:36.320 --> 06:38.140
Hello!

06:49.720 --> 06:52.060
Mimi! Get out!

06:52.080 --> 06:55.230
It's dangerous here.
Get out quickly!

06:55.230 --> 06:56.760
Grandpa, behind you!

07:11.370 --> 07:12.840
That way!

07:21.080 --> 07:23.580
We barely made it.

07:23.720 --> 07:26.890
This is the worst rocking ever.

07:26.960 --> 07:29.080
Mimi, are you all right?

07:31.230 --> 07:33.890
They were finally full-grown...

07:38.770 --> 07:42.690
Our precious babies....

07:44.870 --> 07:46.470
It's all my fault!

07:46.610 --> 07:49.940
It's all because....

07:49.990 --> 07:51.540
Because I trusted that guy, Katari!

07:51.540 --> 07:52.720
Mimi!

07:55.350 --> 07:58.150
Dr. Tonerico, who is Katari?

07:58.290 --> 08:00.230
What on Earth happened?

08:00.280 --> 08:04.450
About a week ago...

08:04.890 --> 08:09.420
this guy Katari showed up

08:09.670 --> 08:12.700
He was a cheerful,
intelligent guy...

08:12.730 --> 08:16.860
and to Mimi
he was like a brother.

08:17.770 --> 08:22.480
And last night,
totally trusting him...

08:22.560 --> 08:26.740
Mimi took him to
the Morning Glory Tower.

08:34.690 --> 08:36.290
Verified.

08:38.590 --> 08:39.800
This way.

08:46.340 --> 08:49.670
Thank you, Mimi.
I wanted to see inside.

08:59.780 --> 09:01.500
Verified.

09:01.570 --> 09:04.480
This is the control room
of the climate-control tower.

09:13.180 --> 09:14.920
Hey, what are you doing?

09:14.950 --> 09:17.490
You can't touch the system!

09:17.540 --> 09:21.270
Don't! Stop! Stop it!

09:25.320 --> 09:26.850
What are you doing?

09:26.960 --> 09:28.070
Wait!

09:28.340 --> 09:31.650
Open up! You promised
you wouldn't touch it!

09:31.680 --> 09:33.340
What are you going to do?

09:41.920 --> 09:44.260
That's why she said that.

09:44.830 --> 09:48.690
If you trust people easily,
you'll have to pay for it.

09:48.690 --> 09:51.380
Katari is still in there.

09:51.440 --> 09:55.700
I've been trying to contact him,
but he won't respond.

09:55.900 --> 09:57.530
What in the world?

09:57.640 --> 10:00.900
What is he trying to do?

10:04.840 --> 10:06.060
What's going on?

10:06.060 --> 10:09.390
What's he doing now?

10:17.490 --> 10:18.620
Oh, no.

10:18.630 --> 10:22.280
The system is getting
totally out of control!

10:22.300 --> 10:26.020
Please evacuate to
the neighboring town with Mimi!

10:26.610 --> 10:28.880
Mimi, go now!

10:30.770 --> 10:33.350
Oh, no!
She must have gone to the tower!

10:46.920 --> 10:50.150
I'm gonna get him.
He destroyed our farm!

10:58.470 --> 11:01.380
We have to turn off
the climate-control system right now!

11:05.470 --> 11:06.620
Mimi!

11:11.950 --> 11:14.370
Mimi! You have to get out now!

11:14.370 --> 11:17.130
No! I have to stop him!

11:18.050 --> 11:20.100
Please help me.

11:20.120 --> 11:22.730
I can't control it anymore.

11:22.990 --> 11:26.450
The only way to stop it
is to go to the core of the system.

11:26.460 --> 11:30.070
What the heck are you saying?
It's your fault!

11:30.170 --> 11:33.000
You thought I did it on purpose?

11:33.060 --> 11:38.070
Last night, I looked at the data and
found that the system was malfunctioning.

11:39.310 --> 11:41.650
Something had to be done...

11:41.680 --> 11:44.690
before the system
got totally out of control.

11:44.740 --> 11:47.390
You never said anything about that!

11:47.450 --> 11:50.210
You have so much respect
for your grandfather.

11:50.300 --> 11:54.160
If I had told you the system
he developed was flawed...

11:54.160 --> 11:56.360
would you have believed me?

11:56.460 --> 11:59.670
Atom, you can't believe
anything he says.

12:06.330 --> 12:09.390
Mimi! What would I have to gain
by destroying the system!

12:10.340 --> 12:13.000
If my purpose was
to steal the program...

12:13.030 --> 12:15.320
I would have just taken it
and left last night!

12:15.380 --> 12:17.530
I wouldn't have risked staying here.

12:17.980 --> 12:21.420
Mimi, everything I told you
the other day is true

12:22.620 --> 12:28.270
Mimi, if it's okay with you
I want to keep working on the farm.

12:28.790 --> 12:32.320
I want to live with you,
Dr. Tonerico and Vegeta

12:35.860 --> 12:38.230
I'm just trying to protect the farm.

12:38.370 --> 12:39.760
Mimi, Atom!

12:39.970 --> 12:41.970
Please believe me!

12:42.700 --> 12:45.130
I don't know.

12:46.440 --> 12:47.710
Let's go together!

12:47.810 --> 12:50.130
Thank you, Atom!
This way!

12:50.210 --> 12:51.210
Mimi!

12:51.870 --> 12:53.190
Wait!

12:53.430 --> 12:55.690
Show the satellite picture
of Rainbow Valley.

12:55.720 --> 12:57.920
The earthquake is expanding
to surrounding areas.

12:57.920 --> 13:00.610
The epicenter occurred at this fault.

13:00.850 --> 13:06.360
Isn't there an old dam for irrigation
northeast of the valley?

13:06.550 --> 13:09.760
The water level must be increasing
from the storm.

13:09.830 --> 13:11.990
If the earthquake
causes a landslide....

13:12.100 --> 13:13.780
The dam will collapse!

13:13.780 --> 13:16.650
Sound the alert right away!

13:31.020 --> 13:33.160
Hurry up!
We don't have time!

13:38.790 --> 13:39.700
Mimi!

13:39.730 --> 13:40.980
Mr. Katari!

13:44.130 --> 13:45.390
Mr. Katari!

13:45.670 --> 13:47.820
If you open the hatch, it'll explode.

13:47.890 --> 13:48.750
What?

13:49.220 --> 13:51.240
You may be all right,

13:51.340 --> 13:52.810
but I don't know about Mimi.

13:52.820 --> 13:56.360
Why? Why are you doing this?

13:56.540 --> 13:59.160
I need to cause this catastrophe...

13:59.210 --> 14:03.430
so that the world will know
that the robots are evil

14:03.430 --> 14:04.550
What?

14:04.820 --> 14:07.100
I'm glad you came.

14:07.420 --> 14:10.840
If you can't stop the farm robots
from getting out of control...

14:10.850 --> 14:15.110
people will lose faith
in the so-called super robot.

14:16.200 --> 14:20.100
So it was all about the robots
from the start.

14:20.300 --> 14:22.870
You robots steal work from humans,

14:22.900 --> 14:27.030
make them lazy. You ruin them.
Remember this:

14:27.150 --> 14:32.350
There are many humans
who hate robots!

14:34.850 --> 14:38.620
Humans hate robots?

14:43.660 --> 14:45.600
I fell for it again.

14:45.970 --> 14:47.530
Are you all right?

14:47.960 --> 14:52.150
Now I know why
you trust people so easily.

14:52.650 --> 14:54.970
It's because robots
don't have hearts.

14:54.970 --> 14:55.910
What?

14:55.910 --> 15:00.380
If you don't have a heart, it doesn't
hurt when someone lies to you

15:00.390 --> 15:04.990
That's why you trust
people so easily.

15:05.050 --> 15:08.790
A robot is made of metal,
it has no heart!

15:35.840 --> 15:38.580
Doctor. The dam will collapse
any second.

15:39.300 --> 15:45.820
Even Palm Town in the south
will be swept away.

15:45.950 --> 15:48.100
Evacuate the residents immediately!

15:48.100 --> 15:49.090
Yes, sir.

15:49.130 --> 15:51.740
A rescue helicopter
just arrived at Robot Farm.

15:53.230 --> 15:56.650
Please, hurry!
The dam is about to collapse.

15:56.670 --> 15:59.960
Everyone, get in!

16:00.000 --> 16:02.090
Grandpa, what happened?

16:01.960 --> 16:04.640
Mimi, Vegeta and the other robots....

16:04.660 --> 16:05.440
What?

16:05.440 --> 16:09.410
What's wrong with them?
At a time like this too.

16:09.940 --> 16:13.090
What are you doing?
Did they all break down?

16:13.110 --> 16:17.510
It can't be!
They've never broken down!

16:19.990 --> 16:24.710
What are you guys doing?
Get out or you'll be swept away!

16:25.500 --> 16:27.780
It can't be...
Vegeta and the other robots....

16:28.120 --> 16:33.660
They can hear the alert and
they know that the flood is coming...

16:33.840 --> 16:38.360
but they don't want to leave the farm.

16:38.410 --> 16:41.490
They love this farm.

16:41.580 --> 16:42.850
That's why....

16:44.610 --> 16:46.080
Mimi, go!

16:46.080 --> 16:47.740
But Vegeta and the others....

16:47.740 --> 16:50.900
I know. I'll protect them.

16:51.390 --> 16:52.580
Atom.

17:02.530 --> 17:05.660
What are you doing, Atom?
Get out of there!

17:08.370 --> 17:10.070
Listen up, everyone!

17:10.110 --> 17:12.380
Let's save the farm together.

17:12.440 --> 17:16.140
I have an idea. Please help me

18:09.630 --> 18:11.650
What on Earth is he trying to do?

18:12.070 --> 18:13.510
Yes, that's right.

18:13.600 --> 18:15.560
The robots suddenly
went out of control...

18:15.560 --> 18:18.270
and destroyed all the systems
on the farm.

18:18.270 --> 18:23.350
Even Atom, the crown jewel of the
Ministry of Science, couldn't stop it.

18:25.510 --> 18:31.400
Dr. Tonerico and his granddaughter
Mimi were killed by the robots.

18:31.400 --> 18:32.590
That's a lie!

18:34.320 --> 18:36.220
I'm alive!

18:36.300 --> 18:38.900
He's a big liar!

18:38.930 --> 18:43.040
He lied to me and
tried to destroy the farm!

18:43.600 --> 18:46.380
You didn't get buried at the tower?

18:53.710 --> 18:59.110
I see! Atom is cutting a path so
the water will flow into the dry lake!

19:11.290 --> 19:12.800
The dam has collapsed!

19:12.800 --> 19:13.790
What?

19:13.790 --> 19:17.140
Doctor, the path Atom made
curves right in front of the farm.

19:17.140 --> 19:18.680
Switch the picture!

19:18.770 --> 19:20.270
Oh, my God!

19:20.440 --> 19:24.580
The water is coming too fast
to make the curve.

19:28.510 --> 19:33.650
Oh, no! The water is
gonna flood the farm.

19:33.690 --> 19:36.240
Zoom in.

19:36.250 --> 19:37.160
Yes, sir.

19:38.420 --> 19:40.150
My God!

20:31.340 --> 20:32.660
Vegeta!

20:36.010 --> 20:38.880
Way to go!
Well done, Vegeta!

20:39.110 --> 20:41.050
Great job, Atom.

20:41.060 --> 20:42.060
Doctor.

20:42.180 --> 20:46.840
Doctor, there are people in this
world who hate robots.

20:46.920 --> 20:49.300
Unfortunately, yes.

20:50.730 --> 20:54.780
Remember, if you keep robots...

20:54.870 --> 20:57.610
they will be the downfall
of the human race!

21:00.600 --> 21:03.930
Just as I expected,
he's an anti-robot radical.

21:04.010 --> 21:06.550
So now they've started
their campaign.

21:08.100 --> 21:12.070
I can start over and over again as long as
I'm with Vegeta and the other robots.

21:12.110 --> 21:14.530
I'm sure you can.

21:14.920 --> 21:16.440
I'm sorry, Atom.

21:16.480 --> 21:17.460
What?

21:17.620 --> 21:20.920
I shouldn't have said
what I said about robots.

21:21.720 --> 21:24.980
They do have hearts,
just like humans.

21:26.160 --> 21:28.820
Look! A huge rainbow!

21:34.070 --> 21:35.790
How beautiful!

21:38.110 --> 21:39.550
Let's go, Mimi.

21:51.690 --> 21:54.700
I'll try to be trusting again.

21:54.820 --> 21:55.720
All right..

22:12.440 --> 22:17.970
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:18.370 --> 22:23.580
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.960 --> 22:29.470
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:29.750 --> 22:35.050
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:35.410 --> 22:40.690
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:41.170 --> 22:49.330
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:49.730 --> 22:52.610
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.820 --> 23:00.820
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:01.410 --> 23:03.820
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:04.250 --> 23:12.530
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.830 --> 23:17.560
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:23.980 --> 23:26.950
Atlas. A robot created by Dr. Tenma

23:27.080 --> 23:29.610
Atlas has challenged me to a duel

23:29.780 --> 23:31.870
What is Dr. Tenma plotting?

23:32.070 --> 23:34.620
Next time:
''Birth of Atlas''

23:34.780 --> 23:37.640
With your heart... Catch the future!
